        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Field Enterprises RPV-200, Solid Brass 2 Oval Ring Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 2 Inch Oval Ring Pull can be used on kitchen cabinets as well as a furniture pull on lightweight drawers and doors. This Oval Ring Pull comes packaged with everything you'll need to install it. The Solid Brass 2 Oval Ring Pull is a great way to add retro detailing to your home. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/2-1-2-inch-oval-ring-pull-field-enterprises-rpv-250\">Large Oval Finger Ring Pull</a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the Oval RPV200 Ring Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Length: 1/2\" square</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with mounting hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
